  {
   "q": "How do smart bird feeders identify birds?",
   "a": "A camera takes photos or video when a bird lands, and AI in the app names the species. Some brands charge a subscription for identification or cloud video; check each pick's notes."
  },
  {
   "q": "Will squirrels raid it?",
   "a": "Probably. Mount it on a pole with a baffle, away from trees and fences squirrels can jump from."
  },
  {
   "q": "How is it powered?",
   "a": "Most run on a rechargeable battery, and many include or offer a solar panel so you rarely need to bring it inside."
  }
